  Original work: LASIESTA database, Grupo de Tratamiento de Imágenes (GTI),
    Universidad Politécnica de Madrid,
    https://www.gti.ssr.upm.es/data/lasiesta_database
    ("This dataset is licensed under the Creative Commons
    Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License")
  Reference: C. Cuevas, E. M. Yáñez, N. García, "Labeled dataset for integral
    evaluation of moving object detection algorithms: LASIESTA", Computer
    Vision and Image Understanding 152, 103-117 (2016),
    doi:10.1016/j.cviu.2016.08.005
  Sequences used: I_SI_01, I_OC_01, I_OC_02
  Changes made: tracks, outlines, markers, text and colour overlays drawn on
    the frames; frames placed side by side with masks; a background image
    estimated from the frames; scaling (including 2x nearest-neighbour
    enlargement), cropping, frame selection and re-encoding (PNG / JPEG / GIF).

